WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.200 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 8=

01:38.920 --> 01:40.719
You don't have to go this far.

01:42.840 --> 01:43.840
Wasn't the whole point today

01:45.280 --> 01:46.519
to get people talking?

01:49.560 --> 01:52.480
We've already put on enough of a show

01:52.840 --> 01:54.040
for everyone watching.

01:57.239 --> 01:58.239
What about you?

01:59.400 --> 02:00.959
Did she tell you
what she's been daydreaming about?

02:02.079 --> 02:03.680
I know what she wants now.

02:04.239 --> 02:05.120
Madam Wei,

02:05.280 --> 02:06.680
(Longevity)
I heard

02:06.680 --> 02:08.439
you obtained a rare set
of Pai Gow tiles.

02:08.759 --> 02:10.120
This set of Pai Gow tiles

02:10.280 --> 02:12.400
was crafted
by a master artisan in Yunze.

02:12.400 --> 02:13.199
I acquired it from him.

02:13.599 --> 02:15.560
Its tiles are carved from premium ivory

02:15.800 --> 02:16.960
with exquisite workmanship.

02:17.199 --> 02:18.479
Every pattern on them

02:18.719 --> 02:20.840
is inlaid with fine gold thread.

02:21.199 --> 02:23.680
Thanks to Madam Wei's reminder just now,

02:24.639 --> 02:25.919
it brought a dream to mind.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.479
Once I dreamed of a set of Pai Gow

02:27.479 --> 02:28.879
just like this one.

02:29.159 --> 02:30.719
Ivory base with gold-thread inlay.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.639
It matches exactly

02:32.840 --> 02:33.960
what Madam Wei described.

02:35.319 --> 02:36.560
When we meet the Sixteenth Master later,

02:37.840 --> 02:38.840
think carefully what to say.

02:39.599 --> 02:40.800
There's one thing I fail to understand.

02:40.919 --> 02:41.879
When seeking bribes,

02:41.879 --> 02:43.199
silver and gold suffice.

02:43.400 --> 02:45.520
Why hunt for rare curios instead?

02:46.080 --> 02:47.120
From what you told me,

02:47.120 --> 02:48.560
this Pai Gow is Madam Wei's

02:48.560 --> 02:49.520
most cherished treasure.

02:49.719 --> 02:50.520
I fear

02:50.639 --> 02:51.840
she will not bear to part with it.

02:52.039 --> 02:54.159
Madam Yan cares deeply for rare curios

02:54.159 --> 02:55.360
for a particular reason.

02:55.840 --> 02:57.240
She has only three daughters

02:57.240 --> 02:58.479
and no sons

02:58.599 --> 03:00.479
to carry on the family legacy.

03:01.479 --> 03:02.919
Those precious artifacts

03:03.039 --> 03:05.280
are meant to be dowries

03:05.280 --> 03:06.919
for her girls' weddings.

03:08.639 --> 03:11.840
Lord Yan holds a vital role
in salt transport.

03:12.280 --> 03:14.120
He ought to act with great caution.

03:14.599 --> 03:17.639
Yet his wife openly takes bribes,

03:18.000 --> 03:20.159
a sign that the couple
has long been at odds.

03:22.039 --> 03:23.599
The one the Sixteenth Master picked

03:23.960 --> 03:25.400
is truly sharp-witted.

03:28.479 --> 03:29.439
Then what shall we do

03:29.560 --> 03:31.120
to get started?

03:39.280 --> 03:41.000
Since Madam Wei holds the key,

03:43.479 --> 03:44.840
let me take this matter in hand.

03:45.639 --> 03:47.199
I have long been acquainted with her.

03:47.199 --> 03:49.199
And I can grasp
her inclinations well enough.

03:49.639 --> 03:51.599
I may mediate between the sides.

03:51.719 --> 03:52.280
Very well.

03:52.759 --> 03:55.360
I shall leave this task to you,
Madam Yu.

04:03.000 --> 04:04.080
Is this the Pai Gow

04:04.080 --> 04:06.520
you just acquired?

04:06.800 --> 04:09.120
We finally get to lay eyes on it today.

04:09.479 --> 04:10.960
I thought we played just yesterday

04:10.960 --> 04:11.919
and now again today.

04:12.000 --> 04:14.000
How can you be so fond of Pai Gow?

04:14.919 --> 04:16.680
It's truly a treasure, isn't it?

04:17.240 --> 04:18.800
It feels cool to the touch

04:18.959 --> 04:20.720
and the gold-thread inlay work
is exquisite.

04:21.040 --> 04:22.600
The feel is utterly unique.

04:23.279 --> 04:24.439
Why don't we

04:25.439 --> 04:26.759
just start playing?

04:27.360 --> 04:28.480
Let's play.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.759
Come on.

04:30.120 --> 04:30.839
Madam,

04:30.839 --> 04:31.879
Madam Yu has arrived.

04:32.720 --> 04:33.759
Madam Yu?

04:39.959 --> 04:40.920
Madam Yu.

04:46.720 --> 04:47.800
Madam Wei, I've heard

04:47.800 --> 04:49.720
you've acquired a rare set of Pai Gow.

04:50.399 --> 04:52.600
I'm hoping to get an identical one
for myself,

04:52.839 --> 04:54.519
but I don't know where to find it.

04:54.959 --> 04:56.360
You are always well-informed,

04:56.360 --> 04:57.680
Madam Yu.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.000
Sadly,

04:59.000 --> 05:00.399
such fine treasures

05:00.600 --> 05:02.639
are never sold on the open market.

05:02.800 --> 05:04.079
I've exhausted all my connections,

05:04.600 --> 05:06.639
searched far and wide,

05:06.800 --> 05:08.480
and finally managed to obtain this set.

05:08.680 --> 05:10.720
I have no wish to part with it
for the time being.

05:11.439 --> 05:12.600
So I truly cannot tell you

05:12.600 --> 05:14.199
where you might find

05:14.199 --> 05:16.000
another exactly the same.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.680
Your husband, Lord Wei,

05:19.680 --> 05:21.920
has served as a sixth-rank governor

05:21.920 --> 05:24.120
under your father for five years.

05:24.519 --> 05:26.040
Word has it recently

05:26.040 --> 05:27.319
he's in line for a promotion.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.160
A curious tale came to my mind.

05:39.879 --> 05:41.079
The other day I watched an opera

05:41.959 --> 05:43.040
telling the story

05:43.240 --> 05:45.639
about a wealthy merchant who married
his daughter to a poor scholar.

05:46.199 --> 05:47.680
After the scholar passed
the imperial exam,

05:47.680 --> 05:49.360
his father-in-law bought him
one official post after another.

05:49.879 --> 05:51.279
When he reached the senior sixth rank,

05:51.519 --> 05:53.720
the merchant refused
to spend another coin on him.

05:54.079 --> 05:55.439
Since you love operas, Madam Wei,

05:55.680 --> 05:56.920
might you enlighten me?

05:57.160 --> 05:58.639
Why was that?

05:59.120 --> 06:00.360
What other reason could there be?

06:00.759 --> 06:02.839
He did not wish
the young man to rise too swiftly

06:03.120 --> 06:04.439
lest he forget his roots.

06:05.680 --> 06:06.800
I see now.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.680
Look at this dog.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.759
It receives such lavish favor.

06:17.240 --> 06:19.079
Does it not rely entirely
on its master's power?

06:19.959 --> 06:21.240
If you dote on it,

06:21.319 --> 06:22.639
it becomes a precious plaything.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.519
If you withhold your favor,

06:25.079 --> 06:26.399
it is nothing at all.

06:31.959 --> 06:33.360
But all that aside,

06:33.600 --> 06:35.560
it still manages to amuse me.

06:37.079 --> 06:39.800
You don't wish Lord Wei
to climb ranks too hastily,

06:40.360 --> 06:42.199
yet you cannot bear to see him wronged.

06:43.199 --> 06:45.079
I have a plan that satisfies both sides.

06:47.199 --> 06:49.639
My husband holds
the post of Left Censor-in-Chief.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.560
All promotions and appointments

06:51.639 --> 06:53.240
of officials
fall under his jurisdiction.

06:53.759 --> 06:55.360
A single letter from me

06:55.519 --> 06:57.600
will make him know exactly
how to arrange this.

06:59.800 --> 07:01.079
In the official world,

07:01.480 --> 07:02.759
steadiness comes first.

07:03.000 --> 07:05.079
We can grant Lord Wei
a minor half-rank promotion first.

07:05.240 --> 07:07.319
Let him train under his father-in-law
for several years,

07:07.319 --> 07:08.759
to temper his character.

07:09.120 --> 07:10.240
Once he is transferred to the capital,

07:10.800 --> 07:12.199
he shall receive
a full promotion at once.

07:14.879 --> 07:17.160
You truly understand me, Madam.

07:28.199 --> 07:29.199
(Yu Residence)

07:29.199 --> 07:29.920
Madam,

07:30.040 --> 07:31.839
this was delivered
by Madam Wei's messenger.

07:40.720 --> 07:41.639
Ms. Shu,

07:42.720 --> 07:43.879
deliver this Pai Gow

07:44.560 --> 07:46.360
to the Xie Residence on Yangliu Lane.

07:47.000 --> 07:48.160
Yes, Madam.

07:49.280 --> 07:51.600
(Yan Residence)

07:54.839 --> 07:56.000
Master, you're home.

07:56.319 --> 07:57.680
You must be worn out today.

07:57.800 --> 07:59.680
I've prepared soothing tea for you.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.360
Would you care for a cup later?

08:01.600 --> 08:02.279
No need.

08:02.680 --> 08:03.759
You should rest early tonight.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.120
(Lord Yan, Western Capital)
From now on,

08:05.319 --> 08:06.360
(Salt Transport Commissioner)
you must restrain yourself.

08:07.399 --> 08:08.560
Grand Secretary Liu sent word.

08:08.560 --> 08:10.279
The Imperial Envoy
has left the capital in secret.

08:10.680 --> 08:12.600
But there's no trace of him to this day.

08:13.319 --> 08:15.079
When things seem off, something's wrong.

08:15.759 --> 08:16.959
Yes, Master.

08:17.399 --> 08:20.240
I shall decline all banquets tomorrow.

08:20.519 --> 08:22.000
I'll remain in the residence to pray.

08:22.639 --> 08:23.199
Then...

08:25.079 --> 08:25.639
Master...

08:36.440 --> 08:38.760
(Yan Residence)

08:42.720 --> 08:43.639
Miss Xie.

08:44.080 --> 08:45.159
What brings you here?

08:50.879 --> 08:51.919
Madam, perhaps you should take

08:51.919 --> 08:52.759
a look first.

09:08.559 --> 09:10.440
You are truly resourceful.

09:10.600 --> 09:12.840
Everyone has their own way.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.960
It suffices if I can ease your worries,
Madam.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.639
I recall

09:16.960 --> 09:18.200
your surname

09:19.159 --> 09:19.879
is Xie?

09:20.399 --> 09:21.039
Yes.

09:22.159 --> 09:24.720
I come from a lesser branch
of the Xie family in Jiangnan.

09:24.960 --> 09:27.159
My fiance goes by Mr. Zhao.

09:28.039 --> 09:29.240
We control

09:29.240 --> 09:30.600
some salt trading business.

09:32.879 --> 09:34.879
Where do you source your salt?

09:35.320 --> 09:36.480
And how exactly

09:36.480 --> 09:38.320
do you transport it
into Yongning Prefecture City?

09:39.039 --> 09:39.960
Madam,

09:40.440 --> 09:43.039
we load the salt
at Qinglong Gully in Lu Prefecture.

09:43.200 --> 09:45.039
We travel by mule caravan
across the Weibei Tableland.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.639
We pass Xiang Prefecture
without entering Xuantie Pass,

09:48.000 --> 09:50.039
taking a detour through Cuiping Valley
to reach Yongning Prefecture.

09:51.360 --> 09:54.440
The Yulin garrison troops up north
are short on salt.

09:54.799 --> 09:57.080
You dare to ship salt through
the ancient road to Fu Prefecture?

09:57.679 --> 10:00.360
The patrol station
at Sanyan Bridge over there

10:00.360 --> 10:01.720
is not to be trifled with.

10:02.120 --> 10:04.519
On the seventh of every month,
the patrol changes guard.

10:04.840 --> 10:07.240
Hide twenty cartloads of wheat straw
in the Huanglong Mountain hollow.

10:07.639 --> 10:09.120
The salt bags go underneath.

10:09.440 --> 10:11.480
Slip the guards some tea money,

10:11.480 --> 10:12.799
and they'll let you through.

10:14.200 --> 10:14.799
Take a seat.

10:16.039 --> 10:18.519
No wonder you come
from a proper merchant family.

10:19.039 --> 10:21.600
Business must be quite substantial,
I imagine?

10:22.080 --> 10:23.440
Throughout the northwest,

10:23.600 --> 10:24.960
no matter how big the business,

10:24.960 --> 10:26.840
it still has to
go through you, Madam Yan.

10:31.559 --> 10:33.480
The other day,

10:33.720 --> 10:35.679
your fiance seemed quite fond of you.

10:42.000 --> 10:43.639
It's all just for show.

10:45.320 --> 10:47.879
Isn't that why he sent me
to come and pay my respects?

10:49.360 --> 10:50.559
When it comes down to it,

10:51.799 --> 10:53.559
it's only for his own business.

10:54.080 --> 10:55.720
He trusts you, though.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.440
This family business is vast,

10:57.519 --> 10:59.120
and you know it inside out.

10:59.360 --> 11:01.039
After all, there are some tasks

11:01.639 --> 11:02.919
he can't show his face for.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.519
Putting a woman forward

11:05.679 --> 11:08.120
is much more convenient
than acting himself.

11:15.399 --> 11:16.159
Madam.

11:16.600 --> 11:18.440
I'd like, on behalf of my fiance,
Mr. Zhao,

11:19.039 --> 11:20.080
to ask

11:20.440 --> 11:21.600
for a salt permit, Madam Yan.

11:21.759 --> 11:22.679
May I ask

11:23.759 --> 11:25.240
if you would grant me this favor?

11:29.879 --> 11:32.440
When salt permits are issued
in a few days,

11:32.440 --> 11:34.120
have Mr. Zhao wait

11:34.600 --> 11:36.120
at the Salt Inspection Station.

11:37.559 --> 11:38.639
Thank you, Madam.

11:42.840 --> 11:43.720
Mr. Yu.

11:44.440 --> 11:45.600
In a few days,

11:45.600 --> 11:46.799
the autumn provincial exam will be held.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.399
The weather's turning cold.

11:49.039 --> 11:50.399
I have sewn a pair

11:50.639 --> 11:52.080
of silk shoes for you.

11:52.399 --> 11:54.879
I hope you stay healthy

11:55.440 --> 11:56.559
and pass the exam with top marks.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.120
Keep them safe.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.600
You think of me every day,

12:23.320 --> 12:25.120
but you should take care of
yourself, too.

12:28.000 --> 12:29.200
Take good care of Miss Fan.

12:29.519 --> 12:31.240
She's feeling upset.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.320
Mozhan,

12:33.159 --> 12:34.200
stop it.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.639
I know Madam favors
the Ninth Young Lady Fu.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.200
I should be more diligent.

13:08.240 --> 13:08.919
Chengxin.

13:10.159 --> 13:10.960
Madam,

13:11.200 --> 13:12.279
recently,

13:12.440 --> 13:13.919
indeed has been
keeping much closer company

13:13.919 --> 13:15.279
with Ninth Young Lady Fu.

13:15.799 --> 13:17.200
My imperial exam is near.

13:18.519 --> 13:19.759
She can't interfere anymore.

13:21.440 --> 13:23.519
So she goes to pester Miss Fan.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.159
Find someone.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.039
My master sent

13:29.039 --> 13:30.679
these Huzhou brushes
and Huizhou ink for you, sir.

13:31.320 --> 13:32.919
May you succeed

13:32.919 --> 13:33.919
in the imperial exams.

13:37.399 --> 13:39.080
Once you get it done,

13:39.559 --> 13:41.960
I can arrange
a top-tier examination hall for you.

13:44.360 --> 13:45.200
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

13:48.279 --> 13:49.159
I am

13:49.240 --> 13:51.039
a Xiucai from Huaying County.

13:51.240 --> 13:54.000
After ten years of hard study,

13:54.360 --> 13:55.799
his talents

13:55.960 --> 13:57.120
remained unrecognized.

13:59.080 --> 14:00.039
But instead,

14:00.480 --> 14:02.440
the Ninth Young Lady Fu favors me.

14:02.919 --> 14:05.039
Good!

14:05.039 --> 14:06.720
Go on!

14:06.720 --> 14:07.399
Her father

14:07.519 --> 14:09.519
is a fifth-rank official in the capital.

14:10.039 --> 14:12.840
Her mother's family,
the Xie family of Jiangnan, is wealthy.

14:13.559 --> 14:15.320
She is blessed and brilliant.

14:15.320 --> 14:16.639
Everyone praises her.

14:17.000 --> 14:17.840
But who knew...

14:18.440 --> 14:19.200
What happened?

14:19.360 --> 14:20.159
What's wrong?

14:20.159 --> 14:23.000
She turned out to be a shameless woman!

14:24.320 --> 14:26.080
Good!

14:26.080 --> 14:27.440
The Xie family of Jiangnan?

14:28.320 --> 14:29.440
Miss Xie?

14:29.960 --> 14:30.799
She was

14:31.159 --> 14:32.759
already betrothed to me,

14:33.080 --> 14:33.960
and threw me over

14:33.960 --> 14:36.559
to chase after an Imperial Envoy!

14:38.080 --> 14:39.120
(Grand Secretary Liu sent word:)

14:39.559 --> 14:41.200
(the Imperial Envoy
has left the capital in secret.)

14:41.679 --> 14:43.480
(But there's no trace
of him to this day.)

14:43.919 --> 14:45.799
Have someone look into her fiance,

14:45.960 --> 14:47.519
Mr. Zhao,

14:47.519 --> 14:48.440
and find out who he really is.

14:48.600 --> 14:49.639
Yes, Madam.

14:51.200 --> 14:53.440
(Yan Residence)

14:54.519 --> 14:55.440
Found it.

14:56.000 --> 14:57.240
The Fu family of Huaying

14:57.399 --> 14:59.639
does have a Ninth Young Lady.

15:00.200 --> 15:01.919
Her mother's family
is the Xie family of Jiangnan.

15:02.440 --> 15:04.120
But Mr. Zhao's background is unknown.

15:04.279 --> 15:05.440
Nothing can be found on him.

15:06.200 --> 15:07.720
(Could he really be an Imperial Envoy?)

15:08.800 --> 15:09.960
(Yong'an)

15:13.840 --> 15:14.559
(Miss Xie,)

15:15.039 --> 15:16.159
(Madam Yan has invited you)

15:16.159 --> 15:17.919
(for tea at Yong'an Wharf right now.)

15:18.200 --> 15:20.159
(Her intentions may not be good.)

15:20.639 --> 15:22.159
(Mr. Zhao is at the wharf today.)

15:22.720 --> 15:23.600
(I must go.)

15:30.840 --> 15:31.879
That's wonderful.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.080
Madam.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.279
Let's leave.

15:47.159 --> 15:48.000
For me,

15:48.200 --> 15:49.720
I hate being lied to more than anything.

15:50.120 --> 15:51.399
You came to do business with me,

15:51.759 --> 15:53.039
but hid who you really are.

15:54.120 --> 15:55.799
If you can't explain yourself today,

15:56.279 --> 15:57.879
I'll kill your man.

16:04.720 --> 16:05.519
Madam.

16:07.279 --> 16:08.960
It's not that I won't be honest.

16:09.679 --> 16:10.679
It's truly...

16:12.399 --> 16:14.440
It's truly hard to speak of.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.799
That Xiucai was right,

16:18.240 --> 16:19.440
but not entirely.

16:19.879 --> 16:21.879
I am indeed from the Fu family
of Huaying.

16:23.919 --> 16:25.679
To appease my cousin's wife

16:25.759 --> 16:27.039
and keep the memorial arch,

16:27.320 --> 16:29.679
they agreed to my betrothal
to that Xiucai.

16:30.200 --> 16:31.360
But right then,

16:31.759 --> 16:33.600
Mr. Zhao came to Huaying on business.

16:33.799 --> 16:35.480
He falsely claimed
to be an Imperial Envoy.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.480
To save myself,

16:38.200 --> 16:39.840
I had no choice but to cling to him.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.480
An Imperial Envoy?

16:44.759 --> 16:45.879
Falsely claimed?

16:49.559 --> 16:50.159
He...

16:52.840 --> 16:54.840
He's nothing but a salt smuggler.

16:58.279 --> 17:00.080
I feared you would worry, Madam,

17:00.440 --> 17:01.759
so earlier

17:01.840 --> 17:03.039
I dared not say more.

17:04.200 --> 17:06.480
After all, we've pledged
our lives to each other.

17:06.759 --> 17:08.319
Mr. Zhao comes from bandit stock.

17:08.720 --> 17:10.519
He's been wanted
by the authorities for ages.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.440
I just...

17:12.960 --> 17:14.319
I just want

17:14.319 --> 17:16.279
a peaceful life, that's all.

17:23.279 --> 17:24.839
That's why I thought

17:25.559 --> 17:27.400
I'd seek your help, Madam,

17:27.480 --> 17:28.799
to ask for a salt permit.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.119
Madam,

17:31.799 --> 17:33.400
I beg you to show mercy.

17:34.000 --> 17:35.880
Even if you won't give us the permit,

17:36.440 --> 17:37.359
I beg you.

17:37.880 --> 17:39.640
Please don't take our lives.

17:46.279 --> 17:47.799
You poor thing.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.920
Quick, help Miss Xie up.

17:53.799 --> 17:55.319
You're overthinking this.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.880
I'm just an ordinary woman.

17:58.359 --> 17:59.680
What could I possibly do to him?

18:01.880 --> 18:03.480
You're so worried about him.

18:03.839 --> 18:04.720
How about

18:05.119 --> 18:06.599
you go and see him?

18:08.240 --> 18:09.319
Thank you, Madam.

18:11.559 --> 18:12.519
Mr. Zhao!

18:27.799 --> 18:28.240
What?

18:28.240 --> 18:30.359
She just ran up
and hugged him right away.

18:30.519 --> 18:31.599
She really did.

18:34.400 --> 18:35.119
Run.

18:35.759 --> 18:36.880
They're going to kill you.

18:43.279 --> 18:44.240
On the boat.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.920
Pass my order. Stick to the plan.

18:51.640 --> 18:53.079
I need to test his true colors.

19:04.599 --> 19:05.799
Your reputation...

19:11.400 --> 19:12.240
Now that we're leaving,

19:14.519 --> 19:15.920
the case can't be investigated anymore.

19:17.480 --> 19:18.880
But just now, with everyone watching,

19:18.880 --> 19:20.079
you acted so close to me.

19:20.640 --> 19:22.480
If you're branded as a woman who eloped,

19:24.079 --> 19:25.759
you'll truly have nowhere to go.

19:29.440 --> 19:31.039
But I can't watch you die.

19:32.519 --> 19:33.880
I'm the one who brought you into this.

19:34.160 --> 19:35.599
I have to make sure you get out alive.

19:35.960 --> 19:37.119
Even if she believes

19:37.319 --> 19:38.799
I ran off with a salt smuggler.

19:39.079 --> 19:40.480
She must not believe

19:40.480 --> 19:41.400
you are the Imperial Envoy.

19:57.920 --> 19:58.839
Too late.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.839
Madam Yan is no ordinary woman.

20:02.559 --> 20:04.160
She's already set her mind
on killing us.

20:06.319 --> 20:07.880
Looks like we'll have to
fight our way out.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.240
Take the water route
and there are our men waiting.

20:18.680 --> 20:19.960
I'll clear a path for us.

21:08.519 --> 21:09.160
Mr. Zhao!

21:09.160 --> 21:10.400
Look who I brought you.

21:13.960 --> 21:14.559
Catch.

21:28.000 --> 21:28.560
(Fur Shop)

21:58.200 --> 21:59.519
So you're the one
who fired the signal arrow.

21:59.599 --> 22:00.279
Who are you?

22:02.440 --> 22:03.480
This is Jiuweijiao.

22:03.680 --> 22:04.400
Mr. Zhao.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.200
Mr. Zhao?

22:06.559 --> 22:07.960
This disguise is pretty good.

22:08.599 --> 22:10.400
Much more handsome than last time.

22:12.680 --> 22:13.599
Show some respect.

22:18.039 --> 22:19.039
This is

22:19.920 --> 22:21.039
Mr. Zhao's true face.

22:27.559 --> 22:29.160
Then remember this face well.

22:30.759 --> 22:31.599
From now on,

22:40.359 --> 22:42.000
we recognize the face, not the token.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.880
Greetings, Mr. Zhao.

23:00.039 --> 23:02.039
(He really is Jiuweijiao.)

23:20.920 --> 23:22.400
Madam Yan, you still dare to come?

23:22.880 --> 23:24.880
I was blind not to recognize greatness.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.680
I didn't know you were

23:27.759 --> 23:30.359
the fearsome Jiuweijiao himself.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.839
So, are we still doing

23:37.039 --> 23:37.960
the salt permit business

23:39.359 --> 23:40.160
or not?

23:40.480 --> 23:41.440
Right now,

23:41.960 --> 23:43.839
the heat is on outside.

23:43.839 --> 23:45.599
The heat is on outside.

23:45.839 --> 23:47.680
If you and your husband are of one mind,

23:47.759 --> 23:48.640
then that's fine.

23:49.400 --> 23:50.400
But unfortunately,

23:50.799 --> 23:52.519
I see that you and Lord Yan

23:52.960 --> 23:54.160
are not on the same page.

23:56.640 --> 23:58.160
What do you mean by that,

23:58.440 --> 23:59.519
Miss Xie?

23:59.680 --> 24:00.920
You know, Madam,

24:01.160 --> 24:03.119
I'm not from a humble family.

24:03.640 --> 24:05.400
I do have some insight.

24:05.880 --> 24:06.599
Madam,

24:07.400 --> 24:09.079
you accept goods but not silver.

24:09.799 --> 24:11.119
That's because once silver

24:11.119 --> 24:12.920
enters the Yan family's accounts,

24:13.319 --> 24:15.359
it will never find its way back to you.

24:15.359 --> 24:17.440
Only as stored goods in the warehouse

24:17.440 --> 24:18.960
can it remain untouched

24:18.960 --> 24:21.240
and be packed
into your three daughters' dowries.

24:26.039 --> 24:28.000
A parent's love is the same everywhere.

24:28.519 --> 24:29.240
Madam,

24:29.759 --> 24:31.519
the storm is indeed fierce right now.

24:31.680 --> 24:33.519
But in these raging waves,

24:33.880 --> 24:36.160
you just happened to run into
Mr. Zhao's ship.

24:45.319 --> 24:48.240
Mr. Zhao wields immense power.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.759
Once you miss,

24:50.359 --> 24:52.039
there'll be no more chance.

25:05.359 --> 25:06.720
Women

25:07.160 --> 25:08.359
fight and claw their way,

25:09.559 --> 25:10.440
all for one thing,

25:10.920 --> 25:12.640
to survive

25:13.680 --> 25:14.759
on what men provide.

25:15.519 --> 25:16.680
Yet some folks

25:18.920 --> 25:20.119
would still share

25:20.680 --> 25:22.480
that little with outsiders.

25:23.599 --> 25:24.359
Enough of this.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.039
Miss Xie,

25:26.599 --> 25:27.680
fate has brought us together.

25:27.799 --> 25:28.640
I'll take

25:29.400 --> 25:30.119
this deal,

25:30.759 --> 25:31.559
but

25:31.920 --> 25:33.119
I have one condition.

25:35.240 --> 25:37.240
Since Madam Yan said
finding the mistress

25:37.240 --> 25:38.440
will earn us the salt permit,

25:39.279 --> 25:40.680
you need not worry too much, Miss Xie.

25:41.880 --> 25:43.400
It'll just take some time.

25:43.839 --> 25:46.519
If he intends to hide his mistress,

25:47.680 --> 25:49.119
he won't easily slip up.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.920
But if Lord Yan begins to suspect

25:53.079 --> 25:54.799
that the child he's carefully raised

25:55.559 --> 25:56.680
is not his own.

25:57.039 --> 25:58.000
What then?

26:00.320 --> 26:01.720
(Peace and Order Prevail
Under Mighty Rule)

26:01.720 --> 26:02.920
You shameless lecher.

26:03.000 --> 26:03.920
Do you confess your crime?

26:04.119 --> 26:05.039
Calm down, My Lord.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.200
I'll confess.

26:09.359 --> 26:10.319
My Lord.

26:10.880 --> 26:11.839
I did indeed steal

26:11.839 --> 26:15.319
into young ladies' chambers.

26:15.319 --> 26:15.799
But

26:15.799 --> 26:18.880
I never defiled

26:18.880 --> 26:21.000
any innocent maiden
from a respectable family.

26:21.200 --> 26:22.680
The one I took a liking to

26:22.960 --> 26:24.519
was a mistress.

26:24.519 --> 26:26.240
A mistress?

26:26.240 --> 26:27.880
You shameless wretch!

26:27.960 --> 26:28.799
Silence!

26:29.160 --> 26:31.519
Just state the facts clearly.

26:32.079 --> 26:33.319
There is no need to recount

26:33.960 --> 26:35.039
your crimes in detail.

26:35.240 --> 26:37.000
Yes, I understand.

26:37.000 --> 26:38.759
Why did I find a mistress?

26:38.960 --> 26:40.400
Mainly for peace of mind.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.279
She usually

26:41.440 --> 26:42.759
doesn't cling to me at all.

26:42.759 --> 26:44.359
Her husband takes Mon, Wed, and Fri,

26:44.359 --> 26:45.559
while I take Tue, Thu, and Sat.

26:45.559 --> 26:46.880
And I don't even have to pay

26:46.960 --> 26:48.640
to raise our child.

26:49.039 --> 26:50.000
Did you hear?

26:50.200 --> 26:52.680
That deflowering thief
just escaped from jail.

26:53.079 --> 26:54.000
Really?

26:54.759 --> 26:56.319
Like a Jiao returning to the sea.

26:56.319 --> 26:57.319
Hope he doesn't strike again.

26:57.319 --> 26:58.599
He wouldn't dare.

26:58.680 --> 26:59.680
What he's looking for

26:59.799 --> 27:01.519
is his old flame.

27:01.680 --> 27:02.880
They even have a child.

27:02.880 --> 27:03.519
Surely

27:03.519 --> 27:04.839
there's still feeling between them.

27:09.400 --> 27:10.480
I heard they got

27:10.640 --> 27:12.599
quite a bit out of that scoundrel
during interrogation.

27:12.599 --> 27:14.759
Dainty undergarments, sachets,

27:15.400 --> 27:17.160
and a rattle-drum.

27:17.599 --> 27:19.480
I wonder which poor fool

27:19.759 --> 27:21.039
got caught up in this mess.

27:21.480 --> 27:22.920
The woman and child

27:23.240 --> 27:24.440
are someone else's.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.960
That child

27:25.960 --> 27:27.759
was born with two fathers.

27:28.200 --> 27:30.039
Isn't that a blessing?

27:32.359 --> 27:33.559
Master, you are back.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.640
(Notify Miss Xie.)

27:57.720 --> 27:58.920
(The fish has taken the bait.)

27:59.839 --> 28:01.240
Ride the horsey!

28:02.200 --> 28:02.960
Having fun?

28:03.119 --> 28:04.000
Yes!

28:04.680 --> 28:05.559
I knew

28:05.559 --> 28:07.160
those people were all talking nonsense.

28:08.240 --> 28:09.359
Your father has things to do.

28:09.359 --> 28:10.279
He'll play with you later.

28:10.279 --> 28:10.880
I want more!

28:10.880 --> 28:11.640
You want more?

28:11.960 --> 28:12.799
Here, sit tight.

28:13.240 --> 28:14.799
Ride the horsey!

28:15.000 --> 28:15.759
Come on!

28:15.759 --> 28:17.319
Ride!

28:20.200 --> 28:21.079
What do you want to eat?

28:21.440 --> 28:22.519
Anything tastes better

28:22.519 --> 28:23.720
with you.

28:35.839 --> 28:36.759
Up you go!

28:43.200 --> 28:44.599
You found the mistress for me.

28:44.920 --> 28:47.079
I'll give you the salt permit
from the Salt Inspection Station.

28:47.599 --> 28:48.440
Do you like that?

28:57.240 --> 28:59.600
(Yan Residence)

29:03.240 --> 29:03.799
Nice.

29:03.799 --> 29:04.200
How is it?

29:04.279 --> 29:05.079
Let me try.

29:09.119 --> 29:10.440
You're pretty good at this.

29:10.559 --> 29:11.200
How about now?

29:11.759 --> 29:12.480
You've got talent.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.119
Just one more stroke.

29:17.000 --> 29:17.920
You little troublemaker!

29:17.920 --> 29:18.640
Stop right there!

29:18.640 --> 29:20.000
I'll get you for that!

29:23.359 --> 29:25.640
(The man thinks a daughter
can't inherit the family legacy.)

29:26.319 --> 29:28.319
(He gives her food and clothes
and calls that love.)

29:29.279 --> 29:31.119
(Yet they are gentle and kind.)

29:31.559 --> 29:32.880
(If they have no money of their own,)

29:33.599 --> 29:35.079
(who will they rely on
once they leave their parents?)

29:42.720 --> 29:43.359
Mr. Zhao,

29:44.160 --> 29:44.880
Zuo Junjie

29:44.880 --> 29:46.880
spreads slander about you
and the Ninth Young Lady.

29:47.079 --> 29:48.079
He's scared

29:48.680 --> 29:49.680
and hiding somewhere.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.119
He must know he's made mistakes

29:54.039 --> 29:55.200
and is hiding from everyone on purpose.

29:55.920 --> 29:56.599
No matter.

29:58.400 --> 29:59.799
The autumn provincial exam draws near.

30:00.519 --> 30:01.720
So we might as well wait

30:03.039 --> 30:05.519
for him.

30:06.559 --> 30:07.559
(Examination Hall)

30:07.559 --> 30:08.039
Give it here.

30:12.520 --> 30:14.120
(Exam Admission Slip: Yu Jingxiu)

30:16.920 --> 30:17.359
Go on.

30:19.359 --> 30:20.319
Grant me success.

30:21.720 --> 30:23.240
Grant me top honors in all three exams.

30:24.720 --> 30:25.240
Go on in.

30:25.240 --> 30:27.079
This young master's features alone

30:27.079 --> 30:28.079
promise certain success.

30:28.079 --> 30:28.880
Indeed.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.279
Look at that finely shaped nose.

30:31.079 --> 30:31.880
You flatter me.

30:31.880 --> 30:32.519
Go on.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.160
I am innocent!

30:33.160 --> 30:34.359
My Lord, you have it wrong!

30:34.359 --> 30:35.759
I am wronged!

30:37.359 --> 30:38.000
Next.

30:39.680 --> 30:41.119
May you two also succeed

30:41.359 --> 30:42.759
and pass with distinction.

30:45.359 --> 30:45.839
Let's go.

30:47.280 --> 30:48.145
(Exam Admission Slip: Zhao Guanlan)

30:48.146 --> 30:48.880
(Exam Admission Slip: Zuo Junjie)

30:54.279 --> 30:55.519
Zuo Junjie cheated on the exam!

30:55.960 --> 30:56.519
My Lord!

30:56.799 --> 30:58.000
This is not mine!

30:58.119 --> 30:58.680
Guards!

30:58.920 --> 30:59.519
Throw him out!

30:59.519 --> 31:00.640
My Lord, this isn't mine!

31:00.640 --> 31:01.039
Move!

31:01.039 --> 31:01.599
Out!

31:01.599 --> 31:02.559
- I need to take the exam!
- Out!

31:02.559 --> 31:03.079
My Lord!

31:03.079 --> 31:04.559
- I have real talent!
- Move!

31:04.559 --> 31:05.160
My Lord!

31:05.160 --> 31:06.640
(Examination Hall)

31:06.640 --> 31:08.000
(Tian-Class Examination Cell No. 9)

31:16.359 --> 31:17.480
Sit down.

31:17.480 --> 31:18.559
I didn't cheat!

31:18.720 --> 31:20.319
You're framing me!

31:20.319 --> 31:21.599
So what if we are?

31:23.160 --> 31:24.000
Mr. Zhao.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.039
What are you going to do about it?

31:30.799 --> 31:32.480
Back when you were in Huaying County,

31:32.839 --> 31:34.599
how did you slander Miss Fu?

31:34.960 --> 31:36.720
Tell me everything in full detail.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.759
I'm just a poor scholar.

31:40.759 --> 31:41.799
I don't know anything.

31:44.759 --> 31:45.759
My nose!

31:46.160 --> 31:47.279
My official career!

31:48.400 --> 31:49.400
According to the law,

31:50.240 --> 31:51.880
you're to be sent to forced labor.

31:54.119 --> 31:55.640
But whether you go there whole

31:59.119 --> 32:01.079
or go there maimed,

32:02.000 --> 32:03.240
that's two different ways.

32:05.480 --> 32:07.279
Tell the truth now.

32:13.000 --> 32:14.279
Write a full confession.

32:15.519 --> 32:17.000
I'll send you to labor.

32:18.279 --> 32:20.880
But if you still dare to talk back,

32:26.519 --> 32:29.279
what gets broken
won't just be your nose.

32:38.319 --> 32:39.559
I'll talk!

32:39.680 --> 32:41.119
I'll tell you everything!

32:41.519 --> 32:42.920
This was all

32:42.920 --> 32:44.400
my sister's idea.

32:44.559 --> 32:46.200
The night before the betrothal proposal,

32:46.359 --> 32:48.000
she called me to her room.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.000
And I went.

32:49.599 --> 32:51.359
(Just follow my instructions)

32:51.480 --> 32:52.920
(and propose to the Old Madam.)

32:54.160 --> 32:55.680
(Tingyun will be yours.)

33:00.960 --> 33:02.160
She also told

33:02.240 --> 33:03.920
Moxiang to steal that thing.

33:04.240 --> 33:05.960
I only took it that day.

33:06.200 --> 33:08.160
Every word I've said is true.

33:08.359 --> 33:10.079
Not a single lie!

33:25.520 --> 33:27.720
(Written Confession)

33:34.920 --> 33:35.640
(Grandmother,)

33:36.200 --> 33:38.480
(I've always taken your teachings
to heart.)

33:38.640 --> 33:40.000
(I would never do anything)

33:40.240 --> 33:41.559
(so shameless)

33:41.559 --> 33:42.880
(or disgraceful to our family.)

33:43.519 --> 33:45.519
(Those two
could not help their feelings.)

33:45.960 --> 33:47.119
(It was fated.)

33:47.960 --> 33:49.880
(Tingyun)

33:50.000 --> 33:52.720
(will soon take root in the Zuo family.)

33:53.440 --> 33:55.039
(Tingyun has fallen ill.)

33:55.799 --> 33:57.599
(Send her to Biyun Nunnery.)

33:59.000 --> 34:00.680
(She'll remain there in seclusion.)

34:02.000 --> 34:05.280
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides♪
(Written Confession: Zuo Junjie)

34:05.280 --> 34:08.680
♪Wash away the stain
of every false accusation♪

34:08.680 --> 34:10.199
♪May all common folk share one roof♪

34:10.199 --> 34:10.920
(If I)

34:10.920 --> 34:12.960
(head to the capital
without clearing things up,)

34:13.239 --> 34:15.000
(won't I be admitting to adultery?)

34:15.760 --> 34:16.800
(Zuo Junjie)

34:16.920 --> 34:18.360
(is going to Yongning Prefecture
for the examinations.)

34:18.559 --> 34:19.440
(I want to go there)

34:19.719 --> 34:21.480
(and find a way to have him captured.
I'll have him interrogated)

34:21.760 --> 34:23.079
(and force him to sign
a written confession.)

34:23.079 --> 34:24.239
(Then I'll go to the capital)

34:24.239 --> 34:25.039
(and use it to clear my name.)

34:27.760 --> 34:30.760
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

34:30.760 --> 34:35.440
♪Trade it for boundless blue
skies to fly free and far♪

34:35.440 --> 34:38.160
♪I seek no mercy♪

34:38.160 --> 34:41.560
♪Lent by mortal world♪
(Signature of Declarant: Zuo Junjie)

34:41.640 --> 34:46.160
♪This mortal world♪

34:47.480 --> 34:49.960
♪Let this mortal world carry me♪
(Signature of Declarant: Zuo Junjie)

34:49.960 --> 34:53.680
♪Through a life adrift♪

34:53.680 --> 34:57.280
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

34:57.280 --> 34:58.679
To climb the ranks,

34:59.239 --> 35:01.000
he framed a defenseless woman.

35:02.079 --> 35:03.000
Send him to the authorities.

35:07.360 --> 35:12.560
♪I crave no clarity♪

35:12.560 --> 35:15.320
♪From outside my soul♪

35:21.679 --> 35:22.679
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

35:25.280 --> 35:26.400
No need for thanks

35:26.639 --> 35:27.519
between us.

35:29.320 --> 35:31.119
You don't intend to charge Zuo Junjie.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.960
But I thought,

35:33.480 --> 35:34.840
when you look back on this journey,

35:36.239 --> 35:37.280
your heart should be at peace.

35:40.440 --> 35:42.199
We're now in the same boat.

35:42.679 --> 35:43.920
It's only right.

35:45.760 --> 35:47.559
I'm always this way with my men.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.880
The results are out!

35:56.880 --> 35:57.760
The results are out!

35:57.760 --> 35:58.559
Wonderful!

35:59.480 --> 36:00.159
Shangwen!

36:00.280 --> 36:01.280
(Top: Yu Jingxiu, Second: Shen Demao)
You're the third!

36:01.280 --> 36:02.239
(Third: Zhou Shangwen)
I'm the third!

36:02.239 --> 36:02.880
You passed!

36:03.039 --> 36:03.599
Mr. Yu!

36:03.599 --> 36:04.360
You're at the top of the list!

36:04.519 --> 36:05.360
You're the Top Scorer!

36:06.400 --> 36:07.800
Congratulations to you, Mr. Yu!

36:08.480 --> 36:09.239
Congratulations!

36:09.239 --> 36:09.760
Thank you.

36:09.760 --> 36:10.159
Thank you.

36:10.159 --> 36:10.800
Congratulations to you, Mr. Yu!

36:10.800 --> 36:11.400
Thank you.

36:12.079 --> 36:13.280
A future pillar of the state!

36:13.280 --> 36:13.840
Indeed!

36:14.360 --> 36:15.119
Impressive!

36:24.400 --> 36:25.119
Madam Yu.

36:25.639 --> 36:26.519
Master Zhao.

36:26.639 --> 36:28.760
I heard Mr. Yu
came in first as Top Scorer.

36:29.199 --> 36:30.679
I've come especially to offer
my congratulations.

36:31.400 --> 36:33.400
The Sixteenth Master left the capital
in a hurry,

36:33.679 --> 36:35.239
and didn't bring any valuables.

36:35.480 --> 36:38.280
So please accept this small token.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.239
My apologies.

36:42.480 --> 36:43.599
I am deeply honored.

36:44.239 --> 36:45.719
My son is still lacking in learning.

36:46.039 --> 36:47.400
It was only by good fortune

36:47.559 --> 36:48.760
and His Highness's blessing

36:48.760 --> 36:49.679
that he passed.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.840
Please rise.

36:55.280 --> 36:56.920
Mr. Yu is both virtuous and talented.

36:57.119 --> 36:58.239
What's more rare

36:58.440 --> 37:00.159
is that he chose
not to seek fame too soon,

37:00.440 --> 37:01.519
in order to help us keep a low profile.

37:13.639 --> 37:15.599
Madam, please be patient
for a few more days.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.119
Once the salt case is solved

37:17.119 --> 37:18.159
and the mission is complete,

37:18.400 --> 37:19.639
you too shall share the success.

37:21.320 --> 37:22.360
I understand.

37:22.800 --> 37:23.960
The Yu family

37:24.840 --> 37:26.079
will continue to act with discretion.

37:30.840 --> 37:32.719
This auspicious sign
of blossoming splendor

37:33.000 --> 37:34.880
has finally come to you.

37:35.480 --> 37:37.920
Mr. Yu became a Top Scorer
in his very first provincial exam.

37:38.159 --> 37:39.599
His future is truly limitless.

37:40.000 --> 37:42.719
If he later scores the other two tops,

37:43.000 --> 37:44.960
wouldn't that be just like in the plays?

37:44.960 --> 37:45.960
Three top honors in a row?

37:46.400 --> 37:47.199
My Lady,

37:47.199 --> 37:49.119
that would make you
a most illustrious lady.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.559
We must ensure

37:53.000 --> 37:54.519
the Deer Banquet is properly prepared.

37:59.239 --> 38:01.119
Have you heard any news
of Fu Tingyun lately?

38:01.679 --> 38:02.679
I heard

38:02.679 --> 38:04.360
her fiance is quite a big shot.

38:04.679 --> 38:06.840
Many families are trying
to curry favor with him.

38:07.639 --> 38:08.960
But I also heard

38:08.960 --> 38:10.039
she's brought shame on herself.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.280
In broad daylight,

38:11.280 --> 38:12.199
she admitted she had eloped.

38:15.760 --> 38:17.039
My Lady,

38:17.159 --> 38:19.000
you're worlds apart from her.

38:19.159 --> 38:20.679
In all of Yongning Prefecture,

38:21.039 --> 38:22.519
which lady

38:22.719 --> 38:23.840
doesn't envy you?

38:27.559 --> 38:28.440
Miss Fan.

38:28.639 --> 38:29.920
Regarding the Deer Banquet,

38:29.920 --> 38:31.800
Madam said to postpone it for now.

38:32.639 --> 38:33.440
Postpone it?

38:36.840 --> 38:38.760
First, we have honored guests.

38:38.920 --> 38:40.039
A noisy feast won't do.

38:40.880 --> 38:41.840
Second,

38:42.039 --> 38:43.159
in a few days,

38:43.559 --> 38:45.320
Jingxiu will leave for the capital exam.

38:45.320 --> 38:46.639
We shouldn't distract him.

38:51.320 --> 38:52.119
Well,

38:52.880 --> 38:54.920
how about hosting a poetry gathering
in my name?

38:55.199 --> 38:56.639
We can rent a garden outside

38:57.440 --> 38:59.480
and invite some ladies
to join the festivity

39:00.119 --> 39:01.679
as a way to thank friends and family.

39:02.719 --> 39:04.159
What do you think, Madam?

39:08.480 --> 39:10.320
Ms. Shu knows a few places.

39:10.679 --> 39:12.119
Have her take you to have a look.

39:15.880 --> 39:16.679
Remember,

39:17.119 --> 39:18.400
keep everything simple.

39:18.880 --> 39:20.199
Be discreet.

39:22.159 --> 39:22.800
Go.

39:29.119 --> 39:30.880
She has improved, hasn't she?

39:32.039 --> 39:33.000
Hosting a poetry gathering.

39:33.000 --> 39:34.360
I'm footing the bill,

39:34.599 --> 39:35.960
but she gets the credit.

39:36.519 --> 39:38.639
Then she'll keep
all the congratulatory gifts,

39:38.639 --> 39:40.679
and win Jingxiu's favor as well.

39:40.920 --> 39:42.239
Such petty schemes

39:42.440 --> 39:44.000
can't escape your notice, Madam.

39:44.480 --> 39:47.159
You simply don't want to let
the young master down,

39:47.159 --> 39:48.360
so you're humoring her.

39:49.400 --> 39:50.960
You know me best.

39:51.440 --> 39:52.159
Take a seat.

39:55.840 --> 39:57.079
I never expected

39:57.079 --> 39:58.440
these little flower cakes

39:58.760 --> 40:01.400
from the imperial kitchen
could be so exquisite.

40:03.079 --> 40:04.440
Send some to Jingxiu.

40:04.519 --> 40:05.559
Let him have a taste.

40:06.360 --> 40:07.280
I'll go right away.

40:10.400 --> 40:12.559
At Cuifu Garden, the banquet
can be humble or lavish.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.440
Ms. Shu suggests

40:14.440 --> 40:15.840
we go with the fifteen-tael spread.

40:15.960 --> 40:17.000
Not overly extravagant.

40:22.760 --> 40:24.559
It's about wit, not cost.

40:24.760 --> 40:26.159
We'll follow it.

40:26.639 --> 40:27.480
Just one thing.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.519
I'll decide on the calligraphy supplies

40:30.000 --> 40:30.800
for the gathering.

40:31.559 --> 40:33.360
Get the Pine-soot ink

40:33.639 --> 40:34.960
and Chengxintang paper.

40:35.039 --> 40:37.159
Pine-soot ink comes from Huizhou.

40:37.400 --> 40:39.400
It may be hard to find on short notice.

40:39.559 --> 40:40.639
Still, we must find it.

40:41.239 --> 40:43.199
I don't have glittering gold headpieces,

40:44.800 --> 40:46.800
or priceless Huzhou silk,

40:47.280 --> 40:49.239
or a decade's worth of Pai Gow skills.

40:51.320 --> 40:53.159
So I'll make elegance my statement.

40:56.159 --> 40:57.840
On the Pine-soot ink sticks

40:58.039 --> 40:59.840
are hidden patterns
of "Five Sons Passing the Exam."

41:00.400 --> 41:01.719
The Chengxintang paper

41:01.800 --> 41:03.679
is crafted like the former dynasty's
imperial style.

41:04.039 --> 41:05.159
In its watermark

41:05.599 --> 41:07.599
is a hidden mark
of "Standing Alone at the Top."

41:08.000 --> 41:08.880
That way,

41:09.199 --> 41:11.320
even if the banquet
uses fifteen-tael spreads,

41:11.480 --> 41:13.519
no one will dare look down on you,
Miss Fan.

41:15.800 --> 41:16.400
Not enough.

41:17.000 --> 41:18.880
Remember Fu Tingyun's gift

41:19.480 --> 41:20.760
at Madam Yan's birthday feast?

41:21.519 --> 41:22.960
Just a few small crabs.

41:23.199 --> 41:24.639
Nothing more than a side dish.

41:24.639 --> 41:25.639
Yet somehow,

41:25.840 --> 41:27.960
it won over all the ladies.

41:30.159 --> 41:31.880
What makes a gift precious
is its rarity.

41:32.519 --> 41:34.320
That's what makes it unforgettable.

41:35.679 --> 41:36.960
We've put thought into this,

41:37.280 --> 41:38.920
but we're still missing some finesse.

41:40.000 --> 41:41.119
We need

41:41.840 --> 41:43.840
something truly unforgettable.

41:48.000 --> 41:50.600
=Next Episode=

41:50.920 --> 41:52.599
Jiuweijiao is such a big shot.

41:53.039 --> 41:54.079
You did business with him

41:54.079 --> 41:55.280
and didn't even tell me?

41:55.559 --> 41:56.599
I told you before,

41:56.599 --> 41:57.880
with the heat on lately,

41:57.880 --> 41:58.960
I need you to be vigilant.

41:58.960 --> 42:00.679
Vigilant!

42:00.920 --> 42:02.480
(You slandered me)

42:02.480 --> 42:03.840
(in front of my future mother-in-law.)

42:04.119 --> 42:06.000
(How can I ever have
a smooth path ahead?)

42:06.440 --> 42:07.639
Even without me,

42:08.039 --> 42:09.360
your days ahead

42:09.599 --> 42:11.360
will never be smooth.

42:11.920 --> 42:12.880
In a few days,

42:14.199 --> 42:15.239
I'm leaving too.

42:16.039 --> 42:16.719
Take care.

42:17.360 --> 42:18.079
Take care.

42:33.040 --> 42:37.360
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

42:40.960 --> 42:45.320
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

42:47.440 --> 42:52.080
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

42:52.320 --> 42:55.120
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

42:56.280 --> 43:00.920
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

43:04.120 --> 43:10.960
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

43:11.840 --> 43:18.360
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

43:19.320 --> 43:22.760
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:23.280 --> 43:27.480
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:27.760 --> 43:33.440
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:45.560 --> 43:49.440
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

43:53.360 --> 43:57.360
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

43:59.080 --> 44:03.760
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

44:04.080 --> 44:06.760
♪Kept close within my heart♪

44:07.840 --> 44:12.680
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

44:16.200 --> 44:23.120
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

44:24.000 --> 44:30.480
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

44:31.360 --> 44:34.880
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

44:35.320 --> 44:39.680
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

44:39.880 --> 44:45.600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
